<h2><span data-i18n="review.common.overview">Overview</span></h2>
<p>Leonardo AI combines powerful image generation with unprecedented control over the creative process. Built for game developers, artists, and designers who need consistency and precision, Leonardo offers advanced features like Canvas editing, character consistency tools, and fine-grained control over every aspect of generation.</p>
<p>What distinguishes Leonardo is its game asset focus and professional toolset. With features like Image Guidance, Prompt Magic, and customizable AI models, Leonardo bridges the gap between AI generation and professional creative work. The platform excels at creating game assets, character art, and iterative design work requiring consistency across multiple outputs.</p>
