<h2 id="image-quality">Image Quality &amp; Style Control</h2>
<h3>Image Quality</h3>
<p>Leonardo AI's Phoenix model represents a significant leap in image generation quality. The platform excels at photorealistic renders, game asset creation, and artistic illustrations. Images are characterized by sharp details, accurate lighting, natural textures, and coherent composition. The platform particularly shines in character design, environmental art, and product visualization where consistency and quality are paramount.</p>
<p>Compared to competitors, Leonardo strikes an excellent balance between creative freedom and technical precision. While Midjourney may excel in artistic interpretation and DALL-E 3 in prompt adherence, Leonardo's strength lies in its fine-grained control and iterative workflow, making it ideal for professional projects requiring multiple revisions and consistency.</p>
<h3>Style Control</h3>
<p>Leonardo offers extensive style control through multiple mechanisms:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Model Selection:</strong> Choose from 15+ specialized models including PhotoReal, Anime Pastel Dream, RPG 4.0, and more for different artistic styles</li>
<li><strong>Image Guidance:</strong> Upload reference images to guide style, composition, and character consistency across generations</li>
<li><strong>Prompt Magic:</strong> Advanced prompt processing that enhances your descriptions with optimal styling parameters</li>
<li><strong>ControlNet:</strong> Use edge detection, pose detection, and depth maps for precise compositional control</li>
<li><strong>Style Presets:</strong> Quick access to popular aesthetic styles from photorealistic to fantasy art</li>
<li><strong>Negative Prompts:</strong> Exclude specific elements, styles, or artifacts from your generations</li>
</ul>
<p>This multi-layered approach to style control makes Leonardo particularly powerful for projects requiring brand consistency, character coherence across multiple images, or specific artistic direction.</p>
<h2 id="commercial-rights">Commercial Usage Rights</h2>
<p>Leonardo AI provides clear commercial usage rights, making it a safe choice for professional projects:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Paid Plans:</strong> Full commercial rights to all images generated with paid subscriptions (Apprentice, Artisan, Maestro)</li>
<li><strong>Free Tier:</strong> Commercial use allowed but with attribution requirements - check current terms</li>
<li><strong>Custom Models:</strong> You retain full rights to custom models trained on your data</li>
<li><strong>Training Data:</strong> Leonardo's models are trained on licensed datasets, reducing copyright concerns</li>
<li><strong>Content Ownership:</strong> You own the outputs you create, subject to the tier's licensing terms</li>
</ul>
<p>For enterprise clients with specific licensing needs, Leonardo offers custom commercial licensing agreements. This makes Leonardo particularly attractive for game studios, marketing agencies, and businesses requiring clear IP ownership.</p>
<h2 id="prompt-engineering">Prompt Engineering</h2>
<h3>Best Practices</h3>
<p>Mastering Leonardo's prompt system unlocks the platform's full potential. Here are proven techniques for optimal results:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Be Specific:</strong> Include details about subject, style, lighting, composition, and mood (e.g., "portrait of a warrior, cinematic lighting, fantasy art style, highly detailed armor")</li>
<li><strong>Use Style Modifiers:</strong> Add quality boosters like "highly detailed," "8K resolution," "professional photography," "trending on ArtStation"</li>
<li><strong>Leverage Negative Prompts:</strong> Exclude unwanted elements (e.g., "blurry, low quality, distorted, extra limbs")</li>
<li><strong>Reference Art Styles:</strong> Mention specific artists, art movements, or visual styles for consistent aesthetic</li>
<li><strong>Control Composition:</strong> Specify camera angles, framing, and perspective (e.g., "wide-angle shot," "close-up portrait," "bird's eye view")</li>
</ul>
<h3>Advanced Techniques</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Prompt Magic:</strong> Enable this feature to automatically enhance your prompts with optimal parameters</li>
<li><strong>Image Guidance Weight:</strong> Adjust how strongly reference images influence the output (0.1-1.0)</li>
<li><strong>Model-Specific Prompting:</strong> Different models respond better to different prompt styles - experiment with each</li>
<li><strong>Iterative Refinement:</strong> Use Canvas to progressively refine generations rather than starting from scratch</li>
</ul>
